point, \eqn{\arg\max_x \sum_y d(x,y)}, which costs \eqn{O(n^2 \cdot
\mathrm{dim})} — the very expense this variant avoids. We substitute the
\eqn{O(n \cdot \mathrm{dim})} proxy \eqn{\arg\max_x \lVert x - \bar{x}
